<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS UP AT $47-1/4 (FIM 215.80).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS UP AT $47-1/4 (FIM 215.80).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR closed up $1-3/4 at $47-1/4 in New York on Thursday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 215.80 markka. In Helsinki on Thursday, Nokia A closed up 7.70 markka at 210.00.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) closed $1 lower at $32-3/4 on Wall Street. The price equals about 74.79 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed down 2.20 markka at 74.10.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR closed flat at $20-1/2 in New York overnight. The price corresponds to 93.63 markka. Rauma closed unchnanged at 94.00 markka in Helsinki.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 240</p>
